            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "Cool, I do it this way:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nMiniPick.setup({\r\n    mappings = {\r\n        sys_paste = {\r\n            char = \"<C-v>\",\r\n            func = function()\r\n                vim.api.nvim_feedkeys(vim.api.nvim_replace_termcodes(\"<C-r>+\", true, true, true), \"n\", true)\r\n            end,\r\n        },\r\n    },\r\n})",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Cool, I do it this way:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"MiniPick.setup({\n    mappings = {\n        sys_paste = {\n            char = &quot;&lt;C-v&gt;&quot;,\n            func = function()\n                vim.api.nvim_feedkeys(vim.api.nvim_replace_termcodes(&quot;&lt;C-r&gt;+&quot;, true, true, true), &quot;n&quot;, true)\n            end,\n        },\n    },\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniPick</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>({\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">mappings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">sys_paste</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">char</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;C-v&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n            <span class=\"pl-en\">func</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>()\n                <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_feedkeys</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_replace_termcodes</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;C-r&gt;+<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>, <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>, <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>), <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>)\n            <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n        },\n    },\n})</pre></div>",
            "bodyText": "Cool, I do it this way:\nMiniPick.setup({\n    mappings = {\n        sys_paste = {\n            char = \"<C-v>\",\n            func = function()\n                vim.api.nvim_feedkeys(vim.api.nvim_replace_termcodes(\"<C-r>+\", true, true, true), \"n\", true)\n            end,\n        },\n    },\n})",
